        "original_id": "e1357c9e-d2ce-502c-bead-64ad086d61cc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sally Field, Lindsay Crouse, Ed Harris, Ray Baker, Amy Madigan, John Malkovich, Danny Glover, Jerry Haynes, Terry O'Quinn, Glenn Close\n- Films: Places in the Heart, The Color Purple, Death of a Salesman, The Glass Menagerie, Empire of the Sun, Dangerous Liaisons, To Sleep with Anger, Predator 2, Angels in the Outfield, Lethal Weapon\n- Topics: film casts, acting careers, notable roles\n\nFacts:\n- In 1984, the film \"Places in the Heart\" starred Sally Field, Lindsay Crouse, Ed Harris, Ray Baker, Amy Madigan, John Malkovich, Danny Glover, Jerry Haynes, and Terry O'Quinn.\n- In the 1980s, John Malkovich began acting in films, including \"Places in the Heart\" (1984) with Sally Field.\n- In 1985, Danny Glover was well known for \"The Color Purple.\"\n- In 1985, John Malkovich appeared in the film \"Death of a Salesman.\"\n- In 1987, John Malkovich appeared in \"The Glass Menagerie\" and \"Empire of the Sun.\"\n- In 1988, John Malkovich appeared in \"Dangerous Liaisons\" with Glenn Close.\n- In 1990, Danny Glover was well known for \"To Sleep with Anger\" and \"Predator 2.\"\n- In 1994, Danny Glover was well known for \"Angels in the Outfield.\"\n- Danny Glover is well known for his leading role as Roger Murtaugh in the \"Lethal Weapon\" film series.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "c50609c7-e59b-5805-ba02-09b1b1c5aba2",
        "text": "Page: Places in the Heart. Sentence: The film stars Sally Field, Lindsay Crouse, Ed Harris, Ray Baker, Amy Madigan, John Malkovich, Danny Glover, Jerry Haynes and Terry O'Quinn.\nPage: Danny Glover. Sentence: He is well known for his leading role as Roger Murtaugh in the \"Lethal Weapon\" film series, \"The Color Purple\" (1985), \"To Sleep with Anger\" (1990), \"Predator 2\" (1990), and \"Angels in the Outfield\" (1994).\nPage: John Malkovich filmography. Sentence: He started acting in the 1980s, appearing in the films \"Places in the Heart\" (1984) with Sally Field, \"Death of a Salesman\" (1985), \"The Glass Menagerie\" (1987), \"Empire of the Sun\" (1987), and \"Dangerous Liaisons\" (1988) with Glenn Close.",
